{"id":1050304,"chapter_id":1050304,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"空から落ちたあの人は、一瞬で怪物たちに埋もれてしまった。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"急速に増加したM値は貪欲で狂暴な者を死瞳に変えた。奴らは今、自らの欲望を赤裸々に曝け出している。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"愚かね……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"真実にも、偽りにも、あなたの言うその責務にさえ向き合うことなく。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"自ら死を選ぶなんて。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"スターゲイザーは廃墟から飛び降りて、寄ってくる死瞳たちが獲物を囲んで叫ぶ姿を冷やかに見ている。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"予言ゲームはいつも人の醜い欲望と恐ろしい真実を暴くのよ。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"とっくに慣れているはずだったのに。","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"スターゲイザー","content":"残念だわ。結局あなたもその資格がないのね……","voice":["vo_trial_50304_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_anarkia_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"スターゲイザーは失望した表情を浮かべたまま、踵を返して歩き出す。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"彼女は手を振りかざし、異能力で怪物たちの欲望を激化して、彼女の「化け物ちゃん」の最後の葬式に花を添える。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":150304011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"少し歩き出した